      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَمَنَّحْتُ المَالَ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>I fed others with the property.</i> So in the trad. of Umm-Zara, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَآكُلُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَأَتَمَنَّحُ</span> (tropical:)  <i>And I eat, and then feed others.</i>
(K, TA.)

